        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present are delighted to present 205 Cooley Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12 to the market a fantastic two-bedroom end of terrace home ideally positioned within this mature and ever-popular residential location. Cooley Road enjoys an exceptionally convenient setting with a fantastic range of local amenities on its doorstep including shops, cafés, restaurants and supermarkets, while Ashleaf Shopping Centre, Our Lady's Children's Hospital, and the LUAS Red Line are all within easy reach. The area is also well served by a selection of primary and secondary schools, numerous sporting and recreational facilities and excellent public transport links, with Dublin City Centre, the M50 and N7 all easily accessible.\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, living room, family room, fully fitted kitchen, two generous double bedrooms and a main family bathroom. The property offers an excellent layout with plenty of scope for the successful purchaser to personalise and make their own.\nExternally, No. 205 enjoys a host of attractive features including a side entrance and a low maintenance south west facing rear garden. The property also benefits from not being directly overlooked to the rear, creating an added sense of privacy. To the front, there is a lawned garden offering excellent potential to create off street parking, subject to the necessary planning permissions. The added benefit of no onward chain ensures a smooth and straightforward purchase.\nWhether you're a first-time buyer looking to step onto the property ladder or an investor seeking a property in a mature and highly convenient location, No. 205 offers a fantastic opportunity with excellent future potential. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\n• c. 72sqm\n• BER C2\n• 2 Bed / 1 Bath\n• End of terrace home\n• Garden to the front\n• Side entrance\n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Low maintenance south west facing rear garden\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• No onwards chain\n• Ideal for growing families and investors\n• Viewing highly advised!\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D12 TH64"
      },
